      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Remainder should also be added for unsigned longs since the range on that can't be captured by just long. It would also be good if the lower precision types byte, sbyte, short, ushort, and uint could have remainder defined as well to keep the operators consistent with the rest of the Udon operators.",
